<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress Oct 4.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress Oct 4.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool Friday detailed the level of harvest progress to Oct 4.</p>
<p> CROP			COMBINED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT) '95</p>
<p> Hard Red Spring Wheat  46		  90</p>
<p> Canada Prairie Spring  35		  90</p>
<p> Soft White Spring Wheat90		  68</p>
<p> Winter Wheat	    100		  98</p>
<p> Durum Wheat		83		  80</p>
<p> Oats			 31		  89</p>
<p> Barley		     54		  86</p>
<p> Flax			 26		  52</p>
<p> Fall Rye		   86		 100</p>
<p> Canola		     48		  88</p>
<p> Total:		     49		  88</p>
<p>--Winnipeg bureau 204-947-3548</p>
</text>
